# Image Optimization

## Principle
Deliver responsive, optimized images by default.

## Guidelines
- Use Astro `<Image>` component from `astro:assets`
- Define width/height to prevent layout shift
- Provide `alt` text for accessibility
- Generate multiple formats: AVIF/WebP
- Use `loading="lazy"` for below-fold images

## Example
```astro
---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import hero from '../assets/hero.jpg';
---
<Image src={hero} alt="Hero image" width={1200} height={600} />
```

## Performance
Set `quality` between 75-85. Use `srcset` for responsive sizes.
